{"id": 1008102, "slug": "ikarus-parkour", "name": "Ikarus Parkour", "name_original": "Ikarus Parkour", "description": "<p>An immersive precision 3D platformer set within a deadly game show, hosted by the Elites for their twisted entertainment. Contestants, who voluntarily sign up, are transported to an 850-meter vertical tower, buried deep underground in an unknown location.</p><p> </p><ul><li><p><strong>Hard Mode</strong> - no checkpoints and a speedrun timer</p></li></ul><ul><li><p><strong>Casual Mode </strong>- frequent checkpoints and no timer.</p></li></ul><p>Reach the top to win a life-changing sum of money and your freedom. However, the stakes are as high as the tower itself—fall, and it’s the end. Every leap and maneuver is a matter of life and death. Can you survive the tower of Ikarus and escape?</p><p>Explore the tower's deadly beauty, an immense structure, split into four distinct levels, each with its own unique aesthetic, new obstacles and increased difficulty.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2025-07-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2025-08-04T14:00:15", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/73a/73a646ebd72d06358178eb5d093638f1.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/781/78125a68d42c8bb61f64d472b66c658a.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": null, "added": 3, "added_by_status": {"owned": 1, "toplay": 2}, "playtime": 0, "screenshots_count": 8, "movies_count": 0, "creators_count": 0, "achievements_count": 0, "parent_achievements_count": 0, "reddit_url": "", "reddit_name": "", "reddit_description": "", "reddit_logo": "", "reddit_count": 0, "twitch_count": 0, "youtube_count": 0, "reviews_text_count": 0, "ratings_count": 0, "suggestions_count": 340, "alternative_names": [], "metacritic_url": "", "parents_count": 0, "additions_count": 0, "game_series_count": 0, "user_game": null, "reviews_count": 0, "community_rating": 0, "s